  dir_exeicon_err_missing.pcpp - break step of dir_exeicon.pcpp: an icon file
  that does not exist (the report names the resolved path)

  How to check, from repo\bin (both targets):
    pcpp res\tests\dir_exeicon_err_missing.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_exeicon_err_missing.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe dir_exeicon_err_missing;
@exeicon "$P:res/assets/icons/missing.ico"; // ERROR SM0105@10: is not an existing file

begin
end.
